      {
        "id": 60323,
        "name": "Karrde",
        "username": "Karrde",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/c0e974/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-01T03:37:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ready for this game to come out, and decided to read some old threads.</p><p>A lot of talk in this one pertaining to the uniqueness of each ship/pilot, and how that comes through with the starting decks. Obviously, as the game goes on and new cards are added to the deck, the theme of those initial cards will be diluted. My question is how often can we expect to cycle through our decks each game? Are we talking 3-5 times, 10-15, etc?</p>",
        "post_number": 26,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:36:20.688Z",
